<title>HUNGARY: ZWACK GROUP Q1 IAS PRE-TAX PROFIT 87 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZWACK GROUP Q1 IAS PRE-TAX PROFIT 87 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March</p>
<p>31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-March 1997  Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	 186	   vs     198</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	    87	   vs	85</p>
<p>    Group gross sales	    2,821	   vs   2,965</p>
<p>    Consumption tax		1,101	   vs   1,236</p>
<p>    Group net sales		1,720	   vs   1,729</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	278	    vs    245</p>
<p>    Depreciation		     78	    vs     70</p>
<p>    Other operating costs	 342	    vs    310</p>
<p>    Financial revenue		 1	    vs	0</p>
<p>    Financial expenditure	 100	    vs    113</p>
<p>NOTE - Zwack Unicum group is a spirits maker.</p>
<p>The figures are consolidated, unaudited and were calculated</p>
<p>in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
